{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Introduction to the Goat Survivor Demo</strong>\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the world of Goat Survivor firsthand! This demo allows you to briefly engage with the core systems of the full game, offering a taste of its unique auto-battle-based survival combat and idle elements.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Content Available in the Demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenge with a Single Character:</strong> Select one from the limited characters available to play.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Limited Stage Provided:</strong> Engage in endless survival combat against incoming enemies on a single stage.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experience Basic Growth System:</strong> Level up during battles and acquire skills to enhance your character.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through this demo, directly experience the core gameplay of Goat Survivor, and look forward to more expansive content upon the official release! Try it for free now!\u200b</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600850?t=1742523200","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600850?t=1742523200","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600850/2142efe9e3325600b58b0ddad417a6e020d7e069/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742523200","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600850/2142efe9e3325600b58b0ddad417a6e020d7e069/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742523200","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Introduction to the Goat Survivor Demo</strong>\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the world of Goat Survivor fir